@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
title State Machine Diagram - Booking Lifecycle v1.1

[*] --> MenungguKonfirmasi : owner submits request via Owner Portal

MenungguKonfirmasi --> Terkonfirmasi : admin approves\n[request still pending and slot capacity revalidated]
MenungguKonfirmasi --> Ditolak : admin rejects\n[rejection reason recorded]
MenungguKonfirmasi --> Dibatalkan : cancellation allowed by policy

Terkonfirmasi --> DijadwalkanUlang : reschedule request accepted for processing
DijadwalkanUlang --> Terkonfirmasi : new slot validated and reschedule confirmed
Terkonfirmasi --> Dibatalkan : cancellation allowed by policy

Ditolak --> [*]
Dibatalkan --> [*]

note right of MenungguKonfirmasi
  Owner submission creates a request,
  not a confirmed appointment.
  Only an authorized admin can approve/reject.
  Slot capacity is revalidated at approval.
end note

note bottom
  Check-in, queue, service completion, and no-show
  belong to the separate Visit lifecycle.
  Invoice and Payment lifecycles are also separate.
end note
@enduml
